#SUBSCRIBED https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zyxingdev/script/main/Stash/Google/Google.stoverride
name: "Google 搜索重定向"
desc: |-
  将 Google 搜索与地图重定向至 .com 域名，如遇频繁跳转请禁用本覆写。
author: |-
  可莉🅥[https://github.com/luestr/ProxyResource/blob/main/README.md]
icon: "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/Google.png"
homepage: "https://hub.kelee.one"

http:

  mitm:
    - "www.google.cn"

  url-rewrite:
    - >-
      ^https?:\/\/(www.)?(g|google)\.cn https://www.google.com 307
    - >-
      ^https?:\/\/(ditu|maps).google\.cn https://maps.google.com 307
